      "content": "i hear you, but \"vocal minority\" is a pretty big assumption. what if the people pushing the tax aren't actually our main customers? if we ignore the economic concerns of the people who think this tax is going to drive up costs for everyone, aren't we just being irresponsible to our shareholders? it feels like you're prioritizing one specific ideology over a balanced business strategy.",
